// expect: 9
// An open-row callee reached from INSIDE another open-row callee's twin —
// the hop past the direct call, where the offset silent wrong survived its
// first fix.
//
// It answered 7, alpha's value, because the proof was severed rather than
// missing: free_in_ty called a BOUND row free, so generalize quantified a
// residual the annotation had already closed and instantiate minted a fresh
// empty cell over it. The emit read that empty cell and took slot 0. Traced
// on mn-findtag, where the close landed on row 24730 and the read on 24736.
fn inner(u: {zeta: Int, ...}) = u.zeta

fn outer(u: {zeta: Int, ...}) = inner(u)

fn main(q) = outer({alpha: 7, zeta: 9})
